Name: LibTIFF
URL: https://gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff
Version: 4.7.2
Revision: d01a94be176f5f6a87f7ee1c0b32e65416aa2b4d
Update Mechanism: Manual
CPEPrefix: cpe:/a:libtiff:libtiff:4.7.2
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
License: libtiff
License File: src/LICENSE.md

Description:
TIFF library. See http://www.simplesystems.org/libtiff/

Local Modifications:

tiffconf.h and tiffvers.h are PDFium's, outside src/. Upstream has only
their templates (tiffconf.h.in, tiffvers.h.in); update tiffvers.h when
the version changes.

The patches are in patches/; copy.bara.sky applies them in this order.

0000-build-config.patch: Local build configuration changes.
0001-no-error-handlers.patch: Set default error handlers.
0028-nstrips-OOM.patch: return error for excess number of tiles/strips.
0031-safe_size_ingtStripContig.patch: return error if the size to read overflow from int32.
0033-avail-out-overflow.patch: signed comparison in PixarLogDecode().
0034-shrink-TIFFFaxTabEnt.patch: make Param member of TIFFFaxTabEnt uint16_t.

Update instructions:
Update commit hashes in crowbar.txtpb, then run from
this directory:
crowbar build --no-dry-run ./
copy.bara.sky lists every file it imports. If the new upstream version
adds a file PDFium needs, add it there and to BUILD.gn.
